 30.0e-4  -0.2                   FW0(cm),FW1; COEFFS FOR FWHM(z)= FW0+FW1*z
 0.0       0.0                   A,B FOR SIGNAL (S) GAUSSIAN NOISE WITH FWHM(S)=sqrt(A+B*S) (USED ONLY FOR DET MODE=2,3)
[END OF PID SECTION]

